@startuml
title Delete Topic Sequence (/api/admin/topics/{id})
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor Admin
boundary "Topics UI" as TopicsPage
control "TopicsController\n(FE Dashboard)" as DashboardController
control "AdminTopicsController\n(BE API)" as ApiController
control "ITopicAdminService" as ITopicAdminService
control "TopicAdminService" as TopicService
entity "Topic" as TopicEntity
control "ITopicAdminRepository" as ITopicAdminRepository
control "TopicAdminRepository" as TopicRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL
note over TopicsPage, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Dashboard calls DeleteTopicAsync through VocaNovaApiClient.
API endpoint is DELETE /api/admin/topics/{id}.
No request DTO body is used; API returns bool in the response envelope.
Delete is soft delete: topic status becomes deleted.
Interfaces used in code: ITopicAdminService, ITopicAdminRepository.
end note
Admin -> TopicsPage: Click Delete topic
TopicsPage -> DashboardController: POST /topics/{id}/delete
DashboardController -> ApiController: VocaNovaApiClient.DeleteTopicAsync(id)\nDELETE /api/admin/topics/{id}
ApiController -> ApiController: Check admin authorization
ApiController -> ITopicAdminService: SoftDeleteAsync(id)
ITopicAdminService -> TopicService: SoftDeleteAsync(id)
TopicService -> ITopicAdminRepository: SetStatusAsync(id, deleted)
ITopicAdminRepository -> TopicRepository: SetStatusAsync(id, deleted)
TopicRepository -> DbContext: Find topic
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT topics
MySQL --> DbContext: Topic row or null
DbContext -> TopicEntity: Materialize Topic?
TopicEntity --> DbContext: Topic or null
DbContext --> TopicRepository: Result
alt Topic not found
TopicRepository --> TopicService: false
TopicService --> ApiController: NotFound result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 404 error
DashboardController --> TopicsPage: Show feedback
else Topic found
TopicRepository -> TopicEntity: Set Status = deleted
TopicEntity --> TopicRepository: Topic updated
TopicRepository -> DbContext: Track Topic status
DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE topics
MySQL --> DbContext: Update result
DbContext --> TopicRepository: Save result
TopicRepository --> TopicService: true
TopicService --> ApiController: Success result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 200 OK
DashboardController --> TopicsPage: Show feedback and refresh list
end
@enduml
